{"pageProps":{"meta":{"id":"obsidian:free-api-text-trial-directory-20261102-en","title":"How long can the free text API trial quota last? A summary of new user bonuses and evaluation interfaces by category","date":"2026-11-03","updated":"2026-11-13","summary":"Classification and organization of new employee bonuses, evaluation keys, and expiration conditions.","categories":[{"id":"markdown-category-0-Resources","name":"Resources","color":"default"}],"categoryNames":["Resources"],"tags":[{"id":"markdown-tag-0-Free API","name":"Free API","color":"default"}],"image":"/obsidian-assets/free-api-text-trial-directory-20261102/cover-fb57d4e283.jpg","coverBlockId":null,"slug":"free-api-text-trial-directory-20261102-en","legacyPaths":[],"lang":"en","translationOf":"free-api-text-trial-directory-20261102","articleType":"article","discoveryName":"How long can the free text API trial quota last? A summary of new user bonuses and evaluation interfaces by category","discoveryCategory":null,"discoveryStage":null,"discoveryUrl":null,"source":"markdown","fixedProductFooter":true},"markdownHtml":"<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Info: Machine translation</strong>\nThis post was machine-translated from the Chinese original. Wording may be rough in places — the <a href=\"https://hyphentech.top/free-api-text-trial-directory-20261102/\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"Opens in a new tab · https://hyphentech.top/free-api-text-trial-directory-20261102/\">Chinese version</a> is authoritative.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Summary</strong>\nNewcomer bonuses, evaluation keys, and developer permissions\nHyphenTech · Data and measurements from November 2, 2026</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Some free interfaces are suitable for a one-week trial, some quotas refresh monthly, and others only allow evaluation or prototyping. You can get the key, but what you can do later is different. This article organizes these easily mixed entry points separately to avoid using the trial wallet to arrange long-term tasks.</p>\n<p>This article is a catalog of first-hand data collected as of November 2, 2026. The following seven items have not yet been generated and tested in this round. Groq, Gemini, OpenRouter, and Agnes that have already produced results are prioritized in the test section; The quota figures here are based on the current structured data and do not rewrite the official website promise as personal testing.</p>\n<h2>First, see if the credit limit will recover, then see how long you can use it</h2>\n<p>“1000 times a month” and “$5 at once” are very different. The former is the experience zone that opens next month, while the latter is a wallet you can claim all at once; Balance, expiration date, and usage restrictions all decide what you can arrange. When sharing credit limits by account, you can’t claim the same amount for each model once.</p>\n<h3>Cohere Evaluation Key (to be tested)</h3>\n<p>**Periodic evaluation quota. **Evaluation key 1,000 API calls per month; Interfaces have additional minute usage limits.</p>\n<p>Assessment of usage; Production and use require production keys and corresponding terms.</p>\n<p>Official portal: <a href=\"https://docs.cohere.com/docs/rate-limits\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"Opens in a new tab · https://docs.cohere.com/docs/rate-limits\">View Information</a>.</p>\n<h3>NVIDIA Managed NIM Development Trial (to be tested)</h3>\n<p>**Access for development purposes. **Developer Program members have free access to managed APIs for prototype development; No unified current quota has been obtained.</p>\n<p>Authorization is based on model cards, member accounts, and development purposes; Local NIM licenses are separate from the custody quota.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-接口基础地址\">https://integrate.api.nvidia.com/v1\n</code></pre>\n<p>Official portal: <a href=\"https://docs.api.nvidia.com/nim/docs/product\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"Opens in a new tab · https://docs.api.nvidia.com/nim/docs/product\">View Information</a>.</p>\n<h3>Cerebras New Account Trial (to be tested)</h3>\n<p>**One-time trial for new users. ** $5 free trial valid for 30 days.</p>\n<p>One-time trial, requires payment when used up or expiring; Not a daily restored permanent free mode.</p>\n<p>Official portal: <a href=\"https://inference-docs.cerebras.ai/support/rate-limits\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"Opens in a new tab · https://inference-docs.cerebras.ai/support/rate-limits\">View Information</a>.</p>\n<h3>Tencent Hunyuan Text, Translation, and Visuals Trial (to be tested)</h3>\n<p>**One-time trial for new users. **Specified text/visual/translation models share 1 million tokens, resource package validity period for 1 year.</p>\n<p>First activation; Main account related model sharing; Excess amounts will be settled as postpaid amounts.</p>\n<p>Official portal: <a href=\"https://cloud.tencent.com/document/product/1729/97731\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"Opens in a new tab · https://cloud.tencent.com/document/product/1729/97731\">View Information</a>.</p>\n<h3>Bailian Current Model Newcomer Quota (to be tested)</h3>\n<p>**Designated models are available for new users to try. **The free quota for new models currently participating is valid for 90 days; the exact amount is subject to model details.</p>\n<p>Real-name registration required; Only Beijing region and universal Key; On October 29, a large number of old models stopped being issued to new users; existing accounts with unexpired balances can continue; Stopped immediately after use, closed by default.</p>\n<p>Official portal: <a href=\"https://help.aliyun.com/zh/model-studio/new-free-quota\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"Opens in a new tab · https://help.aliyun.com/zh/model-studio/new-free-quota\">View Information</a>.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://hyphentech.top/obsidian-assets/free-api-text-trial-directory-20261102/image-aliyun-policy-3a45a5a5ec.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/c9d021a64cdfa8609579b067-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/c9d021a64cdfa8609579b067-1020.webp 1020w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"https://hyphentech.top/obsidian-assets/free-api-text-trial-directory-20261102/image-aliyun-policy-3a45a5a5ec.png\" alt=\"Bailian Current Model Newcomer Quota Official Information\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1020\" height=\"595\"></picture></a></p>\n<h3>Volcano Ark Newbie Reasoning Trial (To Be Tested)</h3>\n<p>**One-time trial for new users. **New users have inference trial quotas; specific model quotas can be checked in activation management.</p>\n<p>Different models are calculated separately and shared under the main account; Only related online inference token fees can be deducted; cannot override plugins, knowledge bases, or cached storage.</p>\n<p>Official portal: <a href=\"https://www.volcengine.com/docs/82379/1399514\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"Opens in a new tab · https://www.volcengine.com/docs/82379/1399514\">View Information</a>.</p>\n<h3>Sarvam Newcomer General Credit Limit (to be tested)</h3>\n<p>**One-time trial for new users. **Each verified user registers with a quota of 100 Indian Rupees; The official statement says the balance is not expiring.</p>\n<p>All API shares; Focus on verifying required language and commercial audio licenses; Exhaust return 402.</p>\n<p>Official portal: <a href=\"https://docs.sarvam.ai/api/getting-started/pricing\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"Opens in a new tab · https://docs.sarvam.ai/api/getting-started/pricing\">View Information</a>.</p>\n<h2>Before activating, identify locations where possible toll transfers may occur</h2>\n<p>The most common point for new user bonuses is automatic over-the-limit billing. Postpaid in Tencent articles and the default “stop when used” in Refinement articles directly affect whether the next transaction will occur. If you plan to test only the free quota, confirm the cancellation conditions in the corresponding product. Don’t unlock all additional features just because a single coupon appears in your account.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://hyphentech.top/obsidian-assets/free-api-text-trial-directory-20261102/image-aliyun-stop-0dc3f5d25a.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/cd1d4bbfc1fe8ccb90e50880-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/cd1d4bbfc1fe8ccb90e50880-1020.webp 1020w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"https://hyphentech.top/obsidian-assets/free-api-text-trial-directory-20261102/image-aliyun-stop-0dc3f5d25a.png\" alt=\"Explanation of Stop When the Hundred Refinements Quota Is Used Up\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1020\" height=\"215\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>There is another time change in this version of Bailian: on October 29, a batch of old models stopped granting free quotas to new users; Existing unexpired balances are treated differently from new account openings. Therefore, the directory retains “current participating models” and does not duplicate an old full model bonus quota table.</p>\n<h2>Which tasks are suitable to use the trial quota first?</h2>\n<p>A fixed document, a random question with reference answers, or a few Chinese paragraphs can easily judge the result and estimate consumption. Directly connect to an automatic looping agent; failed retries and long contexts may quickly use up the bonus; The first time, limit the number of tasks, accept the complete return, then estimate the cost after expansion.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Quote: My judgment</strong>\nIf you only want to verify the interface and performance, the new user quota is very suitable; Plan to run automatically every day, prioritizing solutions with periodic quotas and allowed corresponding uses. Choose one-time bonuses, evaluation purposes, and production services separately; only then will the catalog have practical use.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>Main sources of verification</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.cohere.com/docs/rate-limits\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"Opens in a new tab · https://docs.cohere.com/docs/rate-limits\">Cohere Evaluation Key</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.api.nvidia.com/nim/docs/product\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"Opens in a new tab · https://docs.api.nvidia.com/nim/docs/product\">NVIDIA Managed NIM Development Trial</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://inference-docs.cerebras.ai/support/rate-limits\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"Opens in a new tab · https://inference-docs.cerebras.ai/support/rate-limits\">Cerebras New Account Trial</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://cloud.tencent.com/document/product/1729/97731\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"Opens in a new tab · https://cloud.tencent.com/document/product/1729/97731\">Tencent Hunyuan Text, Translation, and Visual Trial</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://help.aliyun.com/zh/model-studio/new-free-quota\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"Opens in a new tab · https://help.aliyun.com/zh/model-studio/new-free-quota\">Bailian Current Model Newcomer Quota</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.volcengine.com/docs/82379/1399514\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"Opens in a new tab · https://www.volcengine.com/docs/82379/1399514\">Volcano Ark Newcomer Mystery Trial</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.sarvam.ai/api/getting-started/pricing\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"Opens in a new tab · https://docs.sarvam.ai/api/getting-started/pricing\">Sarvam Newcomer General Credit Limit</a></li>\n</ul>\n","relatedPosts":[{"id":"obsidian:free-api-image-directory-20261102","rawId":"obsidian:free-api-image-directory-20261102","slug":"free-api-image-directory-20261102-en","legacyPaths":[],"title":"How to choose a free drawing API: password-free, periodic quota, and new user trial materials directory","date":"2026-11-03","updated":"2026-11-03","summary":"First, look at the actual original image, then select the drawing interface from the free source.","categories":[{"id":"markdown-category-0-资源分享","name":"资源分享","color":"default"}],"categoryNames":["资源分享"],"tags":[{"id":"markdown-tag-0-Free API","name":"Free API","color":"default"}],"pageCover":"/obsidian-assets/free-api-image-directory-20261102/cover-b1ccd2dbec.jpg","cover":"/obsidian-assets/free-api-image-directory-20261102/cover-b1ccd2dbec.jpg","source":"markdown","status":"published","lang":"en","translationOf":null,"articleType":"article","discoveryName":"免费绘图API怎么选：免密、周期额度和新人试用资料目录","discoveryCategory":null,"discoveryStage":null,"discoveryUrl":null,"sourcePath":"posts/free-api-image-directory-20261102.md","fixedProductFooter":true},{"id":"obsidian:free-api-text-recurring-directory-20261102","rawId":"obsidian:free-api-text-recurring-directory-20261102","slug":"free-api-text-recurring-directory-20261102-en","legacyPaths"